{"articleNo":"480304","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=480304&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 제516회 정기 TOEIC 시험 교내 시행 재안내(신청시 학번 입력 필수)","writer":"국제교류교육원","writeDate":"2024.04.12","hit":"3483","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">국립금오공과대학교 국제교류교육원에서 한국<span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC</span>위원회와\n협의를 통해 국립금오공과대학교 재학생의 정기 <span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC </span>시험 응시 편의를 제공하고자&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">아</span>래와 같이 교내에서\n정기 <span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC </span>시험을 개최하게 되어 안내드리오니 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">■제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">516</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">회 정기<span lang=\"EN-US\"> TOEIC </span>시험 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">(2024</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">5</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">26</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">일요일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">오전 진행</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:windowtext\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">1.\n</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">일반</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">: 2024.4.8(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">오전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">10</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">~2024.5.13(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">오전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">10</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">시 응시료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">: 48,000</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">원<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\" style=\"text-indent:9.7pt;mso-char-indent-count:1.0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">특별추가</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">: 2024.5.15(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">오전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">10</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">~2024.5.23(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">낮</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">12</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">시 응시료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">: 52,800</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">원<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">2.\n</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">고사장<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">국립금오공과대학교 국제교육관 2층</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;/ </span></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">총 응시 가능 인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">: 100</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:windowtext\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">※ 응시 인원이 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">20</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">명 미만인 경우 <span lang=\"EN-US\">TOEIC</span>시험이 자동 취소되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">응시한 학생에게 개별 통보 예정<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">3.\n</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">결제방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">수험자가 직접 개별결제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:windowtext\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:windowtext\">:&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">★★<b>신청 시</b></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b>&nbsp;학번 입력 필수!★★</b></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">4. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">환불규정<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>일반접수 및 특별추가접수 수험자는 토익홈페이지<span lang=\"EN-US\">(www.toeic.co.kr)</span>에\n있는 환불률과 같은 환불률을 적용받습니다.</span></p><p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">※취소진행은 모두 수험자 개인이 해야 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">※시험당일 반드시 규정신분증<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>수험표상 규정신분증\n참조<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>을 지참하여야 합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. (</span></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;color:red\">학생증 절대 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">※시험당일 오전 <span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>시 <span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>분까지 입실을 부탁드립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. (</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:red\">9</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:red\">시 <span lang=\"EN-US\">50</span>분 이후 절대 입실 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">※시험당일 필기도구는 지우개로 지울 수 있는 연필 또는 샤프 펜슬 가능<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\nmso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕;color:red\">볼펜<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>사인펜 금지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">※아래의<span lang=\"EN-US\"> URL</span>을 통해서만 국립금오공과대학교\n국제교육관 응시 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"a\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-hansi-font-family:\n함초롬바탕;mso-bidi-font-family:함초롬바탕\">■신청 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:\n함초롬바탕\">URL : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; color: black; background: rgb(225, 240, 240);\">https://exam.toeic.co.kr/common/cert/comp/groupLink.php?comp_type=kumoh</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoShXAjA5gRQNYGkDyBLAjgCQHcANAe3gFkALAL1gC0AVAOgAcA7RIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; color: black; background: rgb(225, 240, 240);\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
